    "detailed_description": "Prove your poker talent and win round after round with a little luck!<br />\r\n<br />\r\nPlay the most popular of all game types &quot;Texas Hold'em&quot; and compete against up to 10 computer-controlled opponents.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nThe carefully implemented game rules for No Limit Texas Hold'em and the graphically excellent representation of the poker round ensure hours of fun and casino feeling.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nBefore a game you can specify almost everything individually, from the number of players to the stakes.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nNot only &quot;experts&quot; will have fun with this software, with the help of the integrated instructions even &quot;beginners&quot; can learn the game principle in no time and become enthusiastic fans of this card game classic.<br />\r\n<br />\r\nStart a game round now and try a &quot;Full House&quot; or even a &quot;Royal Flush&quot;!",
